;; world/rooms/wrongwater/x-3y8.room
(room
  region: wrongwater
  at: (-3 8)
  title: "Stepping Lakes"
  intent: "three small lakes hang at different heights, and the way up is to choose your lake and swim through it, then the next"
  bed: (air 0.15 water 0.5 hang 0.6 drone 0.6)
  light: 0.6
  grid:
  ("#########%  %############"
   "##########~~~############"
   "##########~~~############"
   "###                  ####"
   "###                  ####"
   "###~~~####   #####~~~####"
   "###~~~####   #####~~~####"
   "###                      "
   "###                      "
   "#########################"
   "#########################")
  decor: auto)
;; Two low lakes, each walled on both sides, bottoms two rows over the floor
;; (standing row 8): west (3-5) and east (18-20), rows 5-6. Swim up either
;; and leap out level with its top onto a ledge (west 6-9, east 13-17,
;; standing row 4): two ways up. From either ledge's inner edge a jump
;; enters the high lake (10-12, rows 1-2), and from its top the rough hole
;; (10-11, rough 9 and 12) climbs into the Inverted Fall. Coming down the
;; hole you drop into the high lake and sink out onto the floor. 18 cells of
;; water, all small and walled. East to the Upward Grove (rows 7-8).
